    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><br />Using <math><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
